{"version":1,"content":"\n\n<h5><strong>Podcast</strong></h5>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>影像報道</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>宏福苑報告｜居民質疑高官道歉欠誠意　一局長下台僅「最低消費」</strong></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>上周焦點</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>宏福苑大火報告</strong></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-29-04-1024x682.png\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>李家超率領各高官鞠躬道歉（攝：翁志偉）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-10-29-11-1024x682.png\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>一批宏福苑居民相約觀看記者會轉播。（攝：Nasha Chan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"葉家駒\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-29-38-1024x682.png\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>居民葉家駒（攝：Nasha Chan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-29-03-1024x682.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>獨立委員會的報告的部分內容被遮蓋。（《法庭線》記者攝）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>報告重點</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3UmWULQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">報告・1｜點名宏業、鴻毅是罪魁禍首、唯利是圖　應受最嚴厲批評</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3W2oZsm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">報告・2｜4政府部門須負責　ICU責任較大　若嚴肅履職可減罹難人數</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e5%a0%b1%e5%91%8a3-%e7%84%a1%e8%ad%89%e6%93%9a%e9%a1%af%e7%a4%ba%e9%bb%83%e7%a2%a7%e5%ac%8c%e6%b6%89%e5%9c%8d%e6%a8%99-%e6%8b%9b%e6%a8%99%e5%a6%a5/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">報告・3｜無證據顯示黃碧嬌涉圍標　「招標妥」為防範對象披合法外衣</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3Wc8x8V\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">報告揭6部門收180宗居民投訴　遺屬兩度投訴封窗：政府錯失多次挽救機會　</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4idxutf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">報告重點速讀　宏業、鴻毅是罪魁禍首　ICU執法鬆懈責任較大</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>政府、居民回應</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/48nT2gO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李家超率高官鞠躬道歉　僅何永賢請辭　三局長避答下台問題</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4iubBEN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">問責團隊僅一人請辭　公務員約50人受查　港澳辦讚港府有擔當</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4A4gtb1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">居民觀看記者會　質疑高官道歉欠誠意　一局長下台僅「最低消費」</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zWUB12\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">報告點名批消防處有缺失　鄧炳強稱部門「分工太仔細」　哽咽提前線犧牲</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/48q9FZg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">甯漢豪稱思考過請辭　孫玉菡避答會否捐人工</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>宏福苑其他報道</strong></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-29-28-1024x682.png\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>續准保釋的「宏業」董事侯華健，應訊後離開西九龍法院。（攝：Nasha Chan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-27-02-1024x682.png\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>江祥發應訊後離開區域法院。（《法庭線》記者攝）</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4im9JiN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏業侯華健、鴻毅黃俠然7人被控誤殺等押後再訊　官關注鴻毅會否有代表</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yF4sHJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑法團前委員江祥發夫婦被控欺詐、洗黑錢　押後明年1月再訊</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>蔡天鳳案　</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4svjEWz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳案Day20\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0301_02_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zRedUd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day23｜鄺港智友人：鄺廣州生活富有　有司機接送、名車名錶</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4svjEWz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day24｜重案警：破門進龍尾單位　雪櫃發現兩垃圾袋有人腳殘肢</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4iod5Ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day25｜警供述搜查龍尾單位過程　辯方質疑多警參與現場受干擾</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day26-%e8%ad%a6%e9%95%b7%e5%90%a6%e8%aa%8d%e6%9b%be%e7%b2%97%e6%9a%b4%e5%b0%8d%e5%be%85%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%89%bf%e8%aa%8d%e4%ba%8b%e5%af%a6%e6%8c%87/?utm_source=fb&amp;utm_medium=post&amp;utm_campaign=none\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day26｜警長否認粗暴對待鄺港智　承認事實指錘仔未發現蔡DNA</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zT8ZqY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day27｜鄺球改認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪　控方播片鄺港傑購麻繩稱用於打結</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>王岸然案　</strong></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"王岸然案\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0287_03_link_02-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4etTEF6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day11｜王自辯稱「踩住紅線條邊嚟行」　不曾煽動違法行為</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zbL4mK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day12｜王指認為警方約談僅為了解記者會　自行判斷非查案</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4kldje3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day13｜王盤問下認曾批評李家超、國安處　稱旨在提出建議、警告</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4BCqZb6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day14｜控方質疑王「共產黨以災亂港」論　為煽動憎恨共產黨</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>施駿興與女童非法性交罪成　求情：政治生涯終結　大事主10年不至很嚴重</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4jIVqpn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"施駿興\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026-05-11-03-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>女童周天瑜醫療事故　醫委會早前通知押後醫生紀律研訊　家屬質疑拖延</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yNKQ48\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周天瑜\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0304_04_link_02-copy-1-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>六年前七一維園遇襲警　向施襲者索償至少22萬　供稱受屈辱、有殉職恐懼</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4Blt7nf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"六年前七一維園遇襲警　向施襲者索償至少22萬　警供稱受屈辱、有殉職恐懼\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/popol-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>大律師陳文慧涉FB轉載質疑李國能文章　上訴庭維持違紀裁決惟撤罰款</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4iBXjmN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳文慧\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/0273_01_link_01-copy-1-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>陳朗昇阻差罪成申終院上訴證明書　指《警隊條例》無賦獨立權力查身份證</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4ssCY6T\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳朗昇\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-28-01-1-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>外賣員遇車禍腦部重創　戶戶送申剔除訴訟　爭議沒控制或監控工作</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/48m7y8I\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"戶戶送 申請人駱思俊\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-27-06-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>食環衞生督察涉拒分六合彩獎金　14名同事入稟追討2891萬元</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4ieqTNJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"食環衞生督察涉拒分六合彩獎金　14名同事入稟追討2891萬元\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/mm6l-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>獨立書店塔冷通、長夢承認未備存董事登記冊等　罰款$4000至16000</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4ibQuZ7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"長夢 塔冷通\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/b-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>石牆花遭票控未交公司文件　公司代表缺席聆訊　押後12月訊</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yHR1qv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"石牆花\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-28-04-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>李運騰升上訴庭　任職原訟庭近8年　曾審黎智英、初選47人及支聯會國安案</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yNXwIu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李運騰\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-29-12-1-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:04.635883+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1246,"images":18,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T01:22:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.067156+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.067156+00:00","content_hash":"202550acf8e6b2da16624c7e488c059ae3b3d22b60ae1b0df5d70b4239cd0e4b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}